      "css": ".ds-btn-secondary{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border:none;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms;background:#fff;color:#212529;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #e3e7ed;}.ds-btn-secondary:hover{background:#f6f8fa;}.ds-btn-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0b5cad;outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quiet Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-quiet",
      "description": "바탕 없는 파랑 글자. 곁가지 행동.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-quiet\">추출값이 틀렸나요?</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-quiet{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border:none;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms;padding:0 4px;background:transparent;color:#0b5cad;text-underline-offset:4px;}.ds-btn-quiet:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.ds-btn-quiet:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0b5cad;outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Header",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "header",
      "description": "흰 상단바 56px + 아래 1px 선. 로고 마크·워드마크, 단계 탭, 처리 위치. 견본의 SVG는 public/brand/logo-mark.png 자리 표시일 뿐이며 실제 화면은 로고 이미지를 쓴다.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-header\"><span class=\"ds-brand\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#0d2b57\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"10\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#08a5b3\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2b8a3e\"/></svg>맞물림</span><nav class=\"ds-steps\"><button class=\"ds-step is-done\"><span class=\"ds-step-n\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4.5 10.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\"/></svg></span>확인</button><button class=\"ds-step is-active\"><span class=\"ds-step-n\">3</span>결과</button><button class=\"ds-step\"><span class=\"ds-step-n\">4</span>정렬 맵</button></nav><span class=\"ds-where\"></span></header>",
      "css": ".ds-header{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:56px;padding:0 24px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e7ed;}.ds-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#0d2b57;}.ds-steps{display:flex;align-self:stretch;}.ds-step{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 14px;border:none;background:none;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#5f6670;cursor:pointer;transition:color 150ms;}.ds-step:hover{color:#0d2b57;}.ds-step:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0b5cad;outline-offset:2px;}.ds-step-n{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:9999px;background:#f6f8fa;color:#5f6670;font-weight:700;}.ds-step.is-done{color:#495057;font-weight:600;}.ds-step.is-done .ds-step-n{background:#ebf6ee;color:#2b8a3e;}.ds-step.is-active{color:#0d2b57;font-weight:700;}.ds-step.is-active .ds-step-n{background:#0d2b57;color:#fff;}.ds-step.is-active::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:12px;right:12px;bottom:0;height:3px;border-radius:2px 2px 0 0;background:#0d2b57;}.ds-where{font-size:14px;color:#5f6670;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Severity Label + Strength Badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "strength-badge",
      "description": "10px 의미 색 점 + 같은 색 글자 라벨, 옆에 강도 배지 하나.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-sev ds-sev-red\"><i></i>확인된 오류</span><span class=\"ds-strength\">사실 확인</span></div><div class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-sev ds-sev-orange\"><i></i>지침 권고와 다름</span><span class=\"ds-strength\">권고</span></div><div class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-sev ds-sev-gray\"><i></i>연결 확인 필요</span></div><div class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-sev ds-sev-yellow\"><i></i>제안</span><span class=\"ds-strength\">제안</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-meta{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:4px 0;}.ds-sev{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;}.ds-sev i{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:9999px;background:currentColor;}.ds-sev-red{color:#d7263d;}.ds-sev-orange{color:#e8590c;}.ds-sev-gray{color:#868e96;}.ds-sev-yellow{color:#b08800;}.ds-strength{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:0 8px;border:1px solid #e3e7ed;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#495057;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Result List Item",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "result-item",
      "description": "지적 목록 항목. 선택한 항목만 흰 바탕 + Card 그림자 + 의미 색 4px 왼쪽 선.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-list\"><li><button class=\"ds-item is-active\">‘프로그래밍 프로젝트’ 만점은 30점인데 채점…</button></li><li><button class=\"ds-item\">[9정02-06]는 2022 개정 중학교 정보 성취…</button></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;width:340px;background:#f6f8fa;}.ds-item{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:block;width:100%;padding:8px 12px;border:none;border-left:4px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;font-weight:500;color:#495057;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms;}.ds-item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.7);}.ds-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0b5cad;outline-offset:2px;}.ds-item.is-active{background:#fff;border-left-color:#d7263d;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(13,43,87,0.08);font-weight:700;color:#212529;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Comparison Sheets",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "comparison-sheet",
      "description": "문서 두 장 나란히. 서로 다른 값만 의미 색 700, 같은 값은 흐리게.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-pair\"><div class=\"ds-sheet\"><div class=\"ds-sheet-h\"><b>평가계획서</b><span>plan-error.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"ds-sheet-b\"><div class=\"ds-cap\">평가 요소와 성취기준 · 프로그래밍 프로젝트</div><table><thead><tr><th>평가요소</th><th>배점</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>프로그램 구현</td><td class=\"same\">10</td></tr><tr><td>결과 공유와 개선</td><td class=\"hit\">10</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><span class=\"ds-joint\">≠</span><div class=\"ds-sheet\"><div class=\"ds-sheet-h\"><b>채점기준표</b><span>rubric-error.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"ds-sheet-b\"><div class=\"ds-cap\">수행평가 채점기준 · 프로그래밍 프로젝트</div><table><thead><tr><th>평가요소</th><th>배점</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>프로그램 구현</td><td class=\"same\">10</td></tr><tr><td>결과 공유와 개선</td><td class=\"hit\">5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><p class=\"ds-fix\"><b>고치는 법</b>채점기준표 배점을 더해 30점이 되게 하거나, 평가계획 만점을 25점으로 고치세요.</p>",
      "css": ".ds-pair{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:8px;background:#f6f8fa;padding:16px;}.ds-sheet{flex:1;min-width:0;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(13,43,87,0.08);}.ds-sheet-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef1f5;}.ds-sheet-h b{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#212529;}.ds-sheet-h span{font-size:14px;color:#5f6670;}.ds-sheet-b{padding:8px 16px;}.ds-cap{font-size:14px;color:#5f6670;margin-bottom:4px;}.ds-sheet table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;color:#495057;}.ds-sheet th{text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#5f6670;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e7ed;padding:0 6px 4px;}.ds-sheet td{padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef1f5;}.ds-sheet td.same{color:#5f6670;}.ds-sheet td.hit{color:#d7263d;font-weight:700;}.ds-joint{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#d7263d;}.ds-fix{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;color:#212529;margin:12px 16px;}.ds-fix b{font-weight:700;margin-right:8px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Badges",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-resolved",
      "description": "재점검 상태: 해결됨(초록+체크), 남음(회색), 새로 생김(빨강).",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-status-row\"><span class=\"ds-status ds-st-ok\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4.5 10.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\"/></svg>해결됨</span><span class=\"ds-status ds-st-left\">남음</span><span class=\"ds-status ds-st-new\">새로 생김</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-status-row{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:flex;gap:16px;}.ds-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;}.ds-st-ok{background:#2b8a3e;}.ds-st-left{background:#868e96;}.ds-st-new{background:#d7263d;}"
